/obj/item/paper{
	name = "salvage report";
	default_raw_text = "Salvage report, filed on settlement of the claim. The hull was recovered adrift with her reactor cold and no distress beacon running. Power had failed at the generator rather than at the bus, and everything forward of the port wing was still holding air. Eight crew were listed on the last filed manifest. Two sets of remains were recovered from the bridge and one from the cafeteria; the other five are unaccounted for and are still carried as missing. The recovered remains were interred aboard, under the plaque set into the bridge deck where they were found. The ship's logs end nine days after her last port call and record no emergency. The claim was settled without contest and the vessel was re-registered to her present owners. Her logs, manifests and charts were kept aboard and are shelved in the gallery with the rest of the collection."
